<text x="114.808" y="8.636" size="1.778" layer="94">Light Plate - Royal Blue &amp; Far Red LEDs</text>
<text x="133.35" y="4.826" size="1.778" layer="94">1.0</text>
<text x="110.49" y="4.826" size="1.778" layer="94">180528</text>
<text x="7.62" y="243.84" size="2.54" layer="98">Vf_blue = 2V5..3V5 -&gt; 9..6 LEDs in series, take 7</text>
<text x="7.62" y="165.1" size="2.54" layer="98">Vf_far-red  = 1V4..2V2 -&gt; 17..10 LEDs in series, take 11</text>
<text x="7.62" y="238.76" size="2.54" layer="98">ROYAL BLUE: 440..455nm</text>
<text x="7.62" y="160.02" size="2.54" layer="98">FAR RED: 720..740nm</text>
